Athenaion (Leonxlnx/athenaion) carries an Operator-designated pinned
architectural research reference at `9b8bd23b39c458a50fb1201037360047781c45b5`. Its
shared scene plan, named placement slots, footprint exclusions, per-module
build/test contracts, multi-reference camera comparisons and deterministic
render budget inform the next Loom generalization backlog. They do not
certify native BRep validity, calibration, inherited generative lineages
or Elyncia canon. Consult the dedicated attributed research meme before
claiming an upstream technique has transferred.

