<<~ ahu #/relational-inheritance-design>>

!! Design witness · relation before shape

The retired research register and detailed engineering design remain in the Git archive. The active working design is owned by `lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/projection-loom/relational-inheritance-design`. They compare complete-region copying, source-goal inheritance, a derived native-observed route-family witness and parent-conditioned reconstruction. The C+D working choice requires a distinct native-admitted descendant under the same OODA-HA helm; the current two-epoch topology test does not yet prove that claim. The new Deep Research app report remains separate uninspected testimony until supplied.

